== Path to Arkbolt ==

The path to Arkbolt is very straightforward; just warp to Port Haven, then sail a bit to the upper-right.  You shouldn't even encounter that many monsters along the way.  Once you're there, make sure you have a Amos, Carver, Milly, and Nevan party.

[[File:DQ6 Path to Arkbolt.jpg]]

== Arkbolt ==

[[File:DQ6 Arkbolt.png|thumb|float=right|Map of Arkbolt]]

There are yet more doors that you cannot unlock yet, but that's fine; you can still get the [[File:Dragon Warrior 3 SNES Small Medal.png]] <span style="color:green">12-13th Mini Medals</span> as well as some new equipment here.  You'll want to buy the Battle Axe for Carver, one Silver Cuirass for Milly, and two Magic Shields for Nevan and Amos.    Also keep that in mind that Yggdrasil Leaf amounts will no longer be given, as they will vary depending on the player.

